And sometimes he irritates me, doesn't he?

56
00:01:58.188 --> 00:01:59.149
Really?

57
00:01:59.149 --> 00:02:01.720
Do you see it? Wouldn't he irritate you?

58
00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.978
