No.

60
00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.723
OK, well that's good, because we have a gift for you.

61
00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:12.949
Come on in, Jordan.

62
00:02:12.949 --> 00:02:16.267
I look around your house, and I see a lot of clues that

63
